            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kate Pfaff"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was a great way to use up the veggies from my farm box. I added a little broccoli to the first round of veggies in the pan, and they cooked just fine. I also realized half way through that I didn't have couscous or quinoa like I thought I had. So, I used arborio rice and made it into a kind of risotto. Took longer to cook but it worked okay in the end. The raisins are the key in this recipe, really good plump raisins. Yum!"
          },
