            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "dahome"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very excited to make this dish based on ingredients which I followed exactly and found it tasted more like chicken noodle soup than anything else. I added the curry powder to taste which was the reason it got 2 stars and my kids liked it (cause it tasted like chicken noodle soup!) I would make again and use a vegetable soup base instead.",
